            <description sparkle:format="markdown"><![CDATA[# Tangerine 1.1

- Fixed conversion and compression of newer iPhone MOV recordings containing auxiliary spatial-audio tracks.
- Added separate Balanced and Strong video-compression settings, with Balanced as the default for better visual quality.
- Improved Settings search so category searches such as video, audio, image, document, and archive show all related formats.
- Made Balanced the default image-compression setting.
- Removed the purchase button from Settings.
]]></description>
